<mxCell id="t1" value="BP_MODE=0 resolves every control transfer in EX (2 bubbles when taken); BP_MODE=1 redirects JAL and backward branches from ID (1 bubble), repairs a misprediction from EX.&lt;br&gt;FWD_PRECOMP=1 compares the forwarding selects in ID and registers them, so EX receives them from flops. Memories sit outside the core, without wait states." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;fontStyle=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="625" width="1055.2" height="33.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
